        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. He hallelujah Guang dailiangmeipu,",
            "Thuanmei rui kandih lik kandiu;",
            "Kandih khou guang dailiangmeipu nang rui,",
            "Mei guai lungning khou lat ncham lou o.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Jaipat dat ro tat man kanmei guai,",
            "Jip rimei guaita nchiang thao o;",
            "Kandih kanloumei guang dailiangmeipu,",
            "Ningsummei le rianramei ram tigan no.",
            "",
            "2. Gaung David le jailoumei Mousi guang,",
            "Kandih guang suang dailiangmei nang;",
            "Ntao khrista le bumang thanmei rui,",
            "Amuh dailiangmei banchuanga nang e.",
            "",
            "3. He guang dailiangmei le kanloumei pu,",
            "Suaihiamloumei kanloumei pu;",
            "Kandih damthao khou douluaimei Laujiu,",
            "Kajei pan rui kandih hei kanlou the.",
            "",
            "4. Dui le kandih damthao mak khou rui,",
            "Thaingam bammei Raguang nang e;",
            "Nei le bu le banchuanga guai 4@& ni,",
            "Nang pan khou ruina gan bam puituang e."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
